rg_files_transcripts/492/","text":null,"like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"unavailable","text_source":null,"text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-491","post_id":"491","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102484216546921","published_at":null,"published_date":"2015-11-19","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/491/","text":"Today Priscilla and I are giving $20 million to continue our support of Education Super Highway to help them connect all of America's classrooms to fast and reliable internet. \n\nIf you've followed my...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102484216546921","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-895","post_id":"895","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10102481211573911/","published_at":null,"published_date":"2015-11-17","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/895/","text":"It's a big day for connecting Africa. In South Africa earlier today, we announced with Airtel Africa that we will be bringing Internet.org free basic services to all 17 countries where they operate....","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10102481211573911/","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-894","post_id":"894","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10102480676710781/","published_at":null,"published_date":"2015-11-17","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/894/","text":"Check out this 360 video timelapse of Facebook's campus. I'm really enjoying these 360 videos. They feel like you're really looking around a new place.","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10102480676710781/","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-490","post_id":"490","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102481809620421","published_at":null,"published_date":"2015-11-17","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/490/","text":"We've activated Safety Check again after the bombing in Nigeria this evening.\n\nAfter the Paris attacks last week, we made the decision to use Safety Check for more tragic events like this going...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102481809620421","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-489","post_id":"489","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102479147679971","published_at":null,"published_date":"2015-11-16","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/489/","text":"This is a great piece about our innovation in connectivity, artificial intelligence and virtual reality.\n\nMany people from these teams at Facebook gave interviews and shared their perspectives on the...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102479147679971","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-893","post_id":"893","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10102473731289461/","published_at":null,"published_date":"2015-11-13","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/893/","text":"Check out this 360 video of surfing in Tahiti shot by our friends at GoPro. I love these new 360 videos on Facebook -- they feel so much more immersive.","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10102473731289461/","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-488","post_id":"488","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102474320149381","published_at":null,"published_date":"2015-11-13","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/488/","text":"My thoughts are with everyone in Paris tonight. \n \nViolence like this has no place in any city or country in the world. \n \nWe've activated Safety Check, so if you're in Paris you can mark yourself...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102474320149381","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-892","post_id":"892","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10102472128331801/","published_at":null,"published_date":"2015-11-12","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/892/","text":"We just started launching 360 video on mobile.\n\n360 video is a completely new experience because you can move the camera around. This opens new ways of sharing experiences and makes you feel like...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10102472128331801/","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-487","post_id":"487","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/photo.php?fbid=10102468271955011&set=a.529237706231.2034669.4&type=3&theater","published_at":null,"published_date":"2015-11-10","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/487/","text":null,"like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"unavailable","text_source":null,"text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-486","post_id":"486","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102466662126121","published_at":null,"published_date":"2015-11-09","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/486/","text":"Yesterday Priscilla and I hosted the winners of the Breakthrough Prize at our home for lunch. They're scientists who study everything from genomics to particle physics, and the work they do is making...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102466662126121","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-485","post_id":"485","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10102465335809071","published_at":null,"published_date":"2015-11-08","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/485/","text":"My next book for A Year of Books is The Idea Factory: Bell Labs and the Great Age of American Innovation.\n\nI'm very interested in what causes innovation -- what kinds of people, questions and...","like_count":null,"likes_ca